# Claude-specific personal / machine-local overlay — rover
# Copy this file to CLAUDE.local.md (gitignored) only when Claude has been
# configured to load it. Other hosts use AGENTIC.local.md where supported.

- Repo path: <absolute path to this repo on your machine>
- Port registry: <path to ports.json> (rover's registered port)
- `ROVER_SECRET`: where it's stored on this machine (e.g. a User env var) — never in a file that gets committed.
- Restart script for the live tailnet instance, if you have one (e.g. a gitignored `serve.local.ps1`).
- Read the shared baseline through this repository's AGENTS.md adapter.
